## Step 2 — Engine correctness (first-use bugs)

Done. src/ and codes/ copies kept byte-identical.

- addressing._is_number: finite scalars only (numpy int/float ok; bool/NaN/arrays out).
  get_parameter + clear_output_ports added.
- engine: clear ports before each trial execute; non-finite measurements fail the
  trial (objective_fitness also refuses NaN instead of scoring 0.0).
- inject: missing dims filled from current parameter values; ledger source
  comes from optimizer.last_ask_sources; _narrate_trial uses params.get;
  narrate errors cannot kill the run.
- CMA-ES: sampler_init_kwargs passes popsize=config.pop_size to CmaEsSampler
  (NSGA still uses population_size).
- NW_SimConfig._stable: functools.partial has no __code__ — hashed via
  func/args/keywords; dict/list/tuple/array globals included in the signature.
- Help text: overwrite / rebuild_network mention frozen random rules in auto;
  NW_Optimization max_generations no longer promises early-stop for multi-objective.

Did not change the study model or drop mean_firing_rate.

